== 1. a task that touches a visual: path sees the whole section, on ITS port ==
visual: web/* · this task touches it: yes
screen: Homepage / Universal Search Bar
shotdir: .polaris/shots/homepage/universal-search-bar
serve: dev 4007
shot BEFORE you edit: snap T-207 4007
shot AFTER you edit: snap T-207 4007
name them: T-207-before-<what>.png and T-207-after-<what>.png, in the shotdir above
port: 4007
proof: TWO non-empty captures for T-207, both newer than your branch base — READ both, then:
       bash ops/polaris handoff --saw "<what the after shot shows, and how it measures against ops/DESIGN.md — PASS / WEAK / FAIL>"
nothing existed to photograph (a brand-new screen)? bash ops/polaris handoff --no-before "<why>" --saw "…"
read: ops/VISUAL.md
== 2. a task that does not touch it still sees the section — with touches it: no ==
visual: web/* · this task touches it: no
screen: (unset — no name for this surface; shots land in misc/)
shotdir: .polaris/shots/misc
serve: dev 4000
shot BEFORE you edit: snap T-300 4000
shot AFTER you edit: snap T-300 4000
name them: T-300-before-<what>.png and T-300-after-<what>.png, in the shotdir above
port: 4000
proof: TWO non-empty captures for T-300, both newer than your branch base — READ both, then:
       bash ops/polaris handoff --saw "<what the after shot shows, and how it measures against ops/DESIGN.md — PASS / WEAK / FAIL>"
nothing existed to photograph (a brand-new screen)? bash ops/polaris handoff --no-before "<why>" --saw "…"
read: ops/VISUAL.md
read: ops/DESIGN.md — the bar this screen must clear
== 3. visual: unset ⇒ ONE line, and nothing else changes anywhere ==
(visual: unset — no capture step; ops/VISUAL.md explains how to add one)
== 4. a committed visual change with NO capture is refused, rc 1, task stays in active/ ==
✅ ownership clean: diff ⊆ files_owned
   no verify: commands on task (acceptance is manual)
⛔ handoff refused: T-207 changed a visual: path but .polaris/shots/T-207-*.png has no capture newer than the branch base — run the shot: line from pack, LOOK at the image, then hand off
rc 1
active: T-207.md
review:
== 5. an EMPTY png is not a capture — a blank image is a failure (VISUAL.md doctrine) ==
✅ ownership clean: diff ⊆ files_owned
   no verify: commands on task (acceptance is manual)
⛔ handoff refused: T-207 changed a visual: path but .polaris/shots/T-207-*.png has no capture newer than the branch base — run the shot: line from pack, LOOK at the image, then hand off
rc 1
== 6. a non-empty capture newer than the branch base passes: rc 0, T-207 in review/ ==
✅ ownership clean: diff ⊆ files_owned
   no verify: commands on task (acceptance is manual)
✅ T-207 → review/. Lock stays until the Integrator lands it. Session may close.
   1 ready task(s) still queued — the board hands you the next step: bash ops/polaris next
